    "text": "Bronzeville Pentecostal congregation founded by a formerly enslaved-generation Georgia migrant woman; healing ministry, interracial membership, radio pioneer, Depression-era feeding program. Neighborhood: Bronzeville. Years active: 1920-present."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "What is Apostolic Church of God?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Large South Side Oneness Pentecostal congregation at 6320 S. Dorchester Ave., Woodlawn. Rev. Arthur M. Brazier merged his Universal Church of Christ congregation with ACOG in 1960 and pastored it until June 1, 2008 (succeeded by his son Dr. Byron T. Brazier); campus milestones include the 1977 sanctuary at 63rd & Kenwood and the 1992 campus at 63rd & Dorchester. Neighborhood: Woodlawn. Years active: 1960-1977; 1977-1992; 1992-present. Status recorded October 2026: standing (active)."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "What is Beautiful Zion Missionary Baptist Church?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Beautiful Zion Missionary Baptist Church, 1406 W. 64th St. (Englewood, Chicago); received a $10,000 Timuel D. Black, Jr. Grant Fund award (Feb 2025) for masonry repairs to its Neoclassical limestone fa\u00e7ade; a community cornerstone for more than a century. Neighborhood: Englewood. Years active: c. 1920s-present."
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "What is Bethel AME Church?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "African Methodist Episcopal congregation at 4440 S. Michigan Ave., Chicago (Grand Boulevard/Bronzeville). Organized in June 1862 as a mission church of Quinn Chapel by Bishop William Paul Quinn after Quinn Chapel's overcrowding; occupied 17 locations before settling at its current site in 1949; celebrated its 155th anniversary June 24\u201325, 2017, under pastor Rev. Jennifer Tinsley, with Bishop Anne Henning Byfield (16th Episcopal District) as anniversary preacher. Member congregation of the African Methodist Episcopal Church (CTL-E-1492). Neighborhood: Grand Boulevard. Years active: 1862\u2013present"
   }
  },
  {
   "@type": "Question",
