   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "What is Christian Tabernacle Church?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Christian Tabernacle Church is a Chicago congregation founded by the Rev. Maceo Woods at 47th Street and Prairie Avenue in the Grand Boulevard neighborhood; the church's own site gives its address as 4712 S. Prairie Ave. Woods founded the church in 1959, after serving as music minister at Hyde Park Bible Church, and the congregation grew from a founding handful to more than 800 members within its first year; its 60th anniversary was marked in 2019. Its choir \u2014 the Christian Tabernacle Concert Choir \u2014 became one of Chicago gospel's signature recording ensembles, releasing albums with Woods for "
   }
  },
  {
