  {
   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "What is New Friendship Baptist Church?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Baptist church at 854 W. 71st Street, Englewood, pastored by Rev. Stroy Freeman. First major staging area for Chicago Freedom Movement rallies and marches on the South Side (1966): Martin Luther King Jr.'s 'My place is in Gage Park' speech (August 4, 1966, with Mahalia Jackson) and the July 29, 1966 march to Halverson Realty both launched from the church. Neighborhood: Englewood. Years active: unspecified."
   }
  },
