   "name": "What is New Genesis Assembly of God Baptist Church?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Black Baptist congregation at 1400 N. Laramie Avenue, Austin, in an eclectic Neo-Gothic building (1924\u20131949) designated a Chicago Landmark in 2025. Built as the Trinity Evangelical Lutheran Church (congregation est. 1870; architect Moritz F. Strauch); became home to the New Genesis Assembly of God Baptist Church in 1997 after the neighborhood's racial transition. Neighborhood: Austin. Years active: 1924-1949\u2013present."
   }
  },
