   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "What is Original Providence Baptist Church?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Historic Black Baptist congregation at 515 N. Pine Avenue, Austin \u2014 founded 1866 by former slaves, Chicago's third-oldest Black church. Building constructed 1902 by the First Baptist Church of Austin (architects Brown, Burton & Davis; Gothic/Tudor Revival), with an attached 1928 school; designated a Chicago Landmark in 2026. Neighborhood: Austin. Years active: 1902\u2013present."
   }
  },
