   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "Turn-of-the-20th-century Englewood movie house at 63rd Street and Normal Boulevard; Lauer Sisters Restaurant later occupied its site. Distinct from the 1926 Englewood Theatre at 63rd & Halsted (CTL-E-1012). Neighborhood: Englewood."
   }
  },
  {
