    "text": "Balaban & Katz movie palace at 63rd & Cottage Grove, Woodlawn. Opened February 16, 1921; 3,520 seats; Rapp and Rapp, French Baroque. First of the B&K \"big three.\" R&B/jazz showcase in its late years. Closed September 19, 1963; demolished shortly after. Neighborhood: Woodlawn. Years active: 1921\u20131963. Status recorded October 2026: Demolished."
   }
  },
