    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "House music club at 326 North Michigan Avenue (1983\u20131988) with resident DJ Ron Hardy. The raw, high-energy counterpart to the Warehouse \u2014 the room where acid house broke: Hardy premiered Phuture's \"Acid Tracks\" there, and his reel-to-reel edits and fearless programming defined a harder Chicago sound. Closed in 1987. Years active: 1983\u20131988."
   }
